      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s first settlers were cowboys from the McClennan ranch who secured land and built a store that became the community’s nucleus.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
